    <innerclass refid="classfccvis_1_1cli_1_1InteractiveShell" prot="public">fccvis::cli::InteractiveShell</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespacefccvis">fccvis</innernamespace>
    <innernamespace refid="namespacefccvis_1_1cli">fccvis::cli</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Interactive command-line shell for FCCVisualization. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Defines the interactive shell used to inspect and control an FCCVisualization session from the command line.</para>
<para>The shell connects the active session to the ROOT Cling interpreter and provides built-in commands for navigating and controlling visualization scenes.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Amir H. Ebrahimnezhad <ulink url="mailto:amir.ebh@cern.ch">amir.ebh@cern.ch</ulink></para>
